{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And you shall place of your splendor upon him.</b> This is the radiance of the skin of his face." "<b>Of your splendor.</b> And not all your splendor. And we learn: the face of Moses is like the sun, the face of Joshua is like the moon (Sifrei; Bava Batra 75)." "<b>So that all the congregation of the children of Israel will hear.</b> That they should conduct themselves toward him with honor and fear, in the manner they conduct themselves toward you."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:13:04.285811880Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}